{"n":85,"name":"Al-Buruj","nameAr":"البروج","meaning":"The Mansions of the Stars","ayahs":22,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلْبُرُوجِ","en":"By the sky containing great stars","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"wal-samāi","en":"By the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"ذَاتِ","tr":"dhāti","en":"containing"},{"ar":"ٱلْبُرُوجِ","tr":"l-burūji","en":"the constellations","root":"برج","lem":"بُرُوج"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْمَوْعُودِ","en":"And [by] the promised Day","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","tr":"wal-yawmi","en":"And the Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْعُودِ","tr":"l-mawʿūdi","en":"Promised","root":"وعد","lem":"مَوْعُود"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَشَاهِدٍ وَمَشْهُودٍ","en":"And [by] the witness and what is witnessed,","w":[{"ar":"وَشَاهِدٍۢ","tr":"washāhidin","en":"And (the) witness","root":"شهد","lem":"شاهِد"},{"ar":"وَمَشْهُودٍۢ","tr":"wamashhūdin","en":"and what is witnessed","root":"شهد","lem":"مَشْهُود"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"قُتِلَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْأُخْدُودِ","en":"Destroyed [i.e., cursed] were the companions of the trench","w":[{"ar":"قُتِلَ","tr":"qutila","en":"Destroyed were","root":"قتل","lem":"قَتَلَ"},{"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","tr":"aṣḥābu","en":"(the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْأُخْدُودِ","tr":"l-ukh'dūdi","en":"(of) the pit","root":"خدد","lem":"أُخْدُود"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ ذَاتِ ٱلْوَقُودِ","en":"[Containing] the fire full of fuel,","w":[{"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","tr":"al-nāri","en":"(Of) the fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"ذَاتِ","tr":"dhāti","en":"full"},{"ar":"ٱلْوَقُودِ","tr":"l-waqūdi","en":"(of) the fuel","root":"وقد","lem":"وَقُود"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"إِذْ هُمْ عَلَيْهَا قُعُودٌ","en":"When they were sitting near it.","w":[{"ar":"إِذْ","tr":"idh","en":"When"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","tr":"ʿalayhā","en":"by it"},{"ar":"قُعُودٌۭ","tr":"quʿūdun","en":"(were) sitting","root":"قعد","lem":"قُعُود"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"وَهُمْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفْعَلُونَ بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ شُهُودٌ","en":"And they, to what they were doing against the believers, were witnesses.","w":[{"ar":"وَهُمْ","tr":"wahum","en":"And they"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"over"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"يَفْعَلُونَ","tr":"yafʿalūna","en":"they were doing","root":"فعل","lem":"فَعَلَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","tr":"bil-mu'minīna","en":"to the believers","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"},{"ar":"شُهُودٌۭ","tr":"shuhūdun","en":"witnesses","root":"شهد","lem":"شاهِد"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا نَقَمُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ إِلَّآ أَن يُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ","en":"And they resented them not except because they believed in Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy,","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"نَقَمُوا۟","tr":"naqamū","en":"they resented","root":"نقم","lem":"نَقَمُ"},{"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"[of] them"},{"ar":"إِلَّآ","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"يُؤْمِنُوا۟","tr":"yu'minū","en":"they believed","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","tr":"bil-lahi","en":"in Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","tr":"l-ʿazīzi","en":"the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَمِيدِ","tr":"l-ḥamīdi","en":"the Praiseworthy","root":"حمد","lem":"حَمِيد"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ","en":"To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allāh, over all things, is Witness.","w":[{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"The One Who"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"for Him"},{"ar":"مُلْكُ","tr":"mul'ku","en":"(is) the dominion","root":"ملك","lem":"مُلْك"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"(of) the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"and Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","tr":"shayin","en":"thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"شَهِيدٌ","tr":"shahīdun","en":"(is) a Witness","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهِيد"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا۟ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا۟ فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ ٱلْحَرِيقِ","en":"Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"فَتَنُوا۟","tr":"fatanū","en":"persecuted","root":"فتن","lem":"فَتَنُ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","tr":"l-mu'minīna","en":"the believing men","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"},{"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","tr":"wal-mu'mināti","en":"and the believing women","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِنَة"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"لَمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَتُوبُوا۟","tr":"yatūbū","en":"they repented","root":"توب","lem":"تابَ"},{"ar":"فَلَهُمْ","tr":"falahum","en":"then for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابُ","tr":"ʿadhābu","en":"(is the) punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","tr":"jahannama","en":"(of) Hell"},{"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","tr":"walahum","en":"and for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابُ","tr":"ʿadhābu","en":"(is the) punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","tr":"l-ḥarīqi","en":"(of) the Burning Fire","root":"حرق","lem":"حَرِيق"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْكَبِيرُ","en":"Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who